		{"id":"851f1e8d655f17b5","type":"text","text":"Incidents for snc_external users would incur a large amount of tech debt due to OOB restrictions on the incident table, as well as portal widgets in the ESC.\n\nIts good for the agent to know they're dealing with an external customer by the fact that they're working a case instead of an inc. Helps them say the right things...","x":-782,"y":-1440,"width":372,"height":290}
